单号查询当前环节。待审批、待补正、审核通过和支付完成应分别理解；不要仅凭主管口头同意就认为系统流程已结束。本文未承诺固定的审核天数和到账时限，急需付款时应补充适用的支付安排说明。", "rrf_score": 0.030303, "bm25_score": 2.222215, "vector_score": 0.505334}, {"doc_id": "D04", "version_date": "2026-02-01", "chunk_id": "c002", "title": "出差住宿规则", "topic": "住宿", "scope": "国内出差", "status": "有效", "parent_id": "r002", "related_ids": [], "heading_path": ["出差住宿规则", "第二条 城市分类与费用口径"], "token_count": 235, "kind": "text", "table_id": null, "row_id": null, "quality_warnings": [], "source_locations": [{"file_id": "D04-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D04_出差住宿规则_跨页表格.pdf", "sha256": "c9384bbeeca21f469c6efc510eee893d76d2fff002f0e681c5bfeeb28a2a97d6", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 1, "bbox": [48.0, 305.6171875, 191.75, 317.1171875], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D04-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D04_出差住宿规则_跨页表格.pdf", "sha256": "c9384bbeeca21f469c6efc510eee893d76d2fff002f0e681c5bfeeb28a2a97d6", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 1, "bbox": [48.0, 332.4765625, 546.75, 377.9765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D04-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D04_出差住宿规则_跨页表格.pdf", "sha256": "c9384bbeeca21f469c6efc510eee893d76d2fff002f0e681c5bfeeb28a2a97d6", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 1, "bbox": [48.0, 393.9765625, 541.5, 421.9765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}], "snippet": "第二条 城市分类与费用口径\n\n本合成制度将北京、上海、广州和深圳列为一线城市，其余表列城市及未列明的其他国内城市按350元标准执行。城市分类仅用于本资料内部规则，不代表外部统计口径；不能因为当地商业活动多或酒店价格高而自行变更分类。\n\n住宿费应以实际发生并有凭据支持的金额申请。低于限额时，不得按限额填报未实际发生的差额；高于限额时，应按事先书面批准要求准备材", "rrf_score": 0.016129, "bm25_score": 2.976316, "vector_score": 0.431403}, {"doc_id": "D02", "version_date": "2026-03-01", "chunk_id": "c016", "title": "费用报销制度乙", "topic": "报销期限", "scope": "未说明", "status": "未说明", "parent_id": "r016", "related_ids": [], "heading_path": ["费用报销制度乙", "第十六条仍需补充的资料"], "token_count": 149, "kind": "text", "table_id": null, "row_id": null, "quality_warnings": [], "source_locations": [{"file_id": "D02-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_scanned/D02_费用报销制度乙_模拟扫描.pdf", "sha256": "545aa231842caf089edb81acf5afb59034f885fca9c050d28d312c53f0902bd2", "method": "ocr", "page": 4, "bbox": [47.80028381347656, 581.84580078125, 179.3568115234375, 594.153271484375], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": 0.9990662444721569}, {"file_id": "D02-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_scanned/D02_费用报销制度乙_模拟扫描.pdf", "sha256": "545aa231842caf089edb81acf5afb59034f885fca9c050d28d312c53f0902bd2", "method": "ocr", "page": 4, "bbox": [47.3772705078125, 608.582666015625, 540.60849609375, 654.841748046875], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": 0.998898540405517}], "snippet": "第十六条仍需补充的资料\n\n现有扫描资料缺少适用部门、正式批准状态、制度优先级、起算细则、补正对期限的影响、超期审批权限及支付时限。即使扫描内容能够完整识别，也不代表这些缺口已经补齐。资料管理方需要提供相应依据后，才能对具体争议给出确定处理意见。", "rrf_score": 0.016129, "bm25_score": 0.381485, "vector_score": 0.531849}, {"doc_id": "D05", "version_date": "2026-01-01", "chunk_id": "c015", "title": "办公网络接入指南", "topic": "VPN", "scope": "全体员工", "status": "有效", "parent_id": "r015", "related_ids": [], "heading_path": ["办公网络接入指南", "第十五节 可疑登录与凭据泄露"], "token_count": 233, "kind": "text", "table_id": null, "row_id": null, "quality_warnings": [], "source_locations": [{"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 4, "bbox": [48.0, 479.1171875, 203.25, 490.6171875], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 4, "bbox": [48.0, 505.9765625, 541.5, 533.9765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}, {"file_id": "D05-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_native/D05_办公网络接入指南_原生.pdf", "sha256": "468dcdffde9e628d40f6b7a32db4b483af08f657c4a450b05524e31b616e15cf", "method": "pdf_text", "page": 4, "bbox": [48.0, 549.9765625, 546.75, 577.9765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": null}], "snippet": "第十五节 可疑登录与凭据泄露\n\n如果误把验证码发给他人、发现本人未发起的验证请求或看到异常登录提示，应停止相关操作并通过企业确认的渠道报告。不要继续向未知联系人提供新的验证码，也不要按陌生消息要求安装不明远程控制软件。\n\n本文仅给出报告原则，不规定账号冻结权限、密码重置步骤或安全事件分级。具体处置需查阅账号与安全事件制度。VPN连接成功不代表某条外部消息可信", "rrf_score": 0.015873, "bm25_score": 2.735943, "vector_score": 0.334253}, {"doc_id": "D02", "version_date": "2026-03-01", "chunk_id": "c004", "title": "费用报销制度乙", "topic": "报销期限", "scope": "未说明", "status": "未说明", "parent_id": "r004", "related_ids": [], "heading_path": ["费用报销制度乙", "第四条规则边界"], "token_count": 129, "kind": "text", "table_id": null, "row_id": null, "quality_warnings": [], "source_locations": [{"file_id": "D02-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_scanned/D02_费用报销制度乙_模拟扫描.pdf", "sha256": "545aa231842caf089edb81acf5afb59034f885fca9c050d28d312c53f0902bd2", "method": "ocr", "page": 1, "bbox": [49.49232788085938, 584.392138671875, 134.51761474609376, 595.850830078125], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": 0.9997214249202183}, {"file_id": "D02-canonical", "source_path": "data/source_materials/corpus/pdf_scanned/D02_费用报销制度乙_模拟扫描.pdf", "sha256": "545aa231842caf089edb81acf5afb59034f885fca9c050d28d312c53f0902bd2", "method": "ocr", "page": 1, "bbox": [49.06931762695312, 608.15830078125, 542.300537109375, 657.388134765625], "line_start": null, "line_end": null, "confidence": 0.9994936534698974}], "snippet": "第四条规则边界\n\n本制度规定提交期限及材料流程，不规定差旅住宿额度、员工借款、外币汇率和付款到账期限。涉及其他制度的事项应读取对应资料，不能将报销提交期限理解为财务处理时限，也不能用资料缺失推定相关费用一律可报。", "rrf_score": 0.015873, "bm25_score": 0.557875, "vector_score": 0.525395}]}}
